  // Electronegativity kept at 0 across all 5 scales for noble-gas-family consistency with He/Ne above, even though real Allred-Rochow (~3.20) and Mulliken-Jaffe (~3.19) values for Ar do exist in the literature (WebElements) -- a deliberate consistency call, not a data gap; flagged here in case a future pass wants to reconsider the noble-gas convention across the board.
