  // ============================================================
  // ELEMENT: Calcium (Ca, Z=20)
  // UFF LJ -- see element_data.rs module docs. EA is a small measured POSITIVE value (2.37 kJ/mol), unlike Be/Mg/Zn/Hg's cleaner 0.0-unbound treatment for the same filled-4s2 pattern -- a real, if weak, bound state, not the same physical situation, so not force-fit to match those.
